      "title": "Hundreds protest against Nathan Cofnas talk on DEI at Oriel College in Oxford",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/nov/17/hundreds-protest-nathan-cofnas-de-oriel-college-oxford-jason-arday",
      "description": "<p>Students oppose appearance of self-described ‘race realist’ who made plagiarism claims against Jason Arday </p><p>Hundreds of protesters filled the cobbled streets around Oriel College, Oxford, to voice their opposition to an appearance by Nathan Cofnas, the self-described “race realist”.</p><p>The event organised by the university’s Reform UK student society – billed as “An evening with Nathan Cofnas: is DEI undermining higher education?” – went ahead on Tuesday evening despite opposition from students, college staff and local politicians concerned that his appearance would create a hostile environment.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/nov/17/hundreds-protest-nathan-cofnas-de-oriel-college-oxford-jason-arday\">Continue reading...</a>",
